om the Free Will and Fatalistic\n572:                                              beliefs in physicalism/materialism, idealism and dualism)—that were directly extracted from previous w      ­ ork6, and\n579:                                              panpsychism, idealistic/solipsistic beliefs (i.e. ‘the physical world is an illusion generated by the mind’), beliefs in\n592:                                            ­Scale53 (suggestibility is known to be sensitive to psychedelic a­ dministration40) were both measured at baseline.\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
