{"type":"item.started","item":{"id":"item_1","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"mkdir -p /Users/chrgre01/src/Sapi/verification/example_site/spaces/metaphysics/runs/run-20260426T152518Z--g2jrtnjpv1/semantic && cat > /Users/chrgre01/src/Sapi/verification/example_site/spaces/metaphysics/runs/run-20260426T152518Z--g2jrtnjpv1/semantic/topic_generation.json <<'JSON'\n{\n  \\\"topics\\\": [\n    {\n      \\\"topic_id\\\": \\\"topic-metaphysical-belief-change-and-grounding-necessity\\\",\n      \\\"title\\\": \\\"Metaphysical Belief Change and Grounding Necessity\\\",\n      \\\"structure_type\\\": \\\"wiki\\\",\n      \\\"sections\\\": [\n        \\\"Psychedelic-associated movement away from hard materialism raises a concept-centric question about whether altered metaphysical commitments track changes in explanatory frameworks or merely changes in endorsed views.\\\",\n        \\\"The grounding-necessity source supplies a contrasting normative framework: full grounds require connecting questions to lack cognitive significance, and essence-based principles are used to derive metaphysical necessitation from genuine full grounding.\\\",\n        \\\"This topic can compare empirical belief shifts toward non-physicalism with philosophical criteria for when explanatory dependence is objective, necessary, and not reducible to a subject's current sense of significance. The support is cross-source but asymmetric: source 04 gives empirical belief-change evidence, while source 01 supplies conceptual constraints on grounding rather than direct claims about psychedelic experience.\\\"\n      ],\n      \\\"claim_ids\\\": [\n        \\\"claim-psychedelic-use-is-associated-with-significant-shifts-away-from-hard-physicalist--b7e61a4e9b3c\\\",\n        \\\"claim-most-psychedelic-associated-shifts-in-non-physicalist-metaphysical-beliefs-persi--9591d5bd7c0c\\\",\n        \\\"claim-participants-with-no-prior-psychedelic-experience-showed-larger-shifts-away-from--056a417d978d\\\",\n        \\\"claim-the-combined-prospective-correlational-mechanistic-and-controlled-trial-evidence--bb114d52608c\\\",\n        \\\"claim-a-fact-p-is-fully-grounded-in-d-only-if-the-connecting-question-asking-why-p-obt--ea3a1a698124\\\",\n        \\\"claim-connecting-questions-lack-cognitive-significance-only-when-fine-style-essential--f96bc70d5d2d\\\",\n        \\\"claim-the-conjunction-of-the-significance-principle-the-essence-principle-and-the-meta--4f212a9f1869\\\",\n        \\\"claim-the-epistemic-constraint-on-grounding-does-not-undermine-grounding-objectivity-b--87922d9890f9\\\"\n      ],\n      \\\"source_ids\\\": [\n        \\\"source-04-psychedelics-alter-metaphysical-beliefs--0d1ce18240f0\\\",\n        \\\"source-01-grounding-necessary-or-contingent--6e8195a096f0\\\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \\\"topic_id\\\": \\\"topic-nonphysicalist-belief-and-truthmaking-structure\\\",\n      \\\"title\\\": \\\"Non-Physicalist Belief and Truthmaking Structure\\\",\n      \\\"structure_type\\\": \\\"wiki\\\",\n      \\\"sections\\\": [\n        \\\"Source 04 reports shifts away from hard materialism toward non-physicalist positions including panpsychism, dualism, and non-naturalism, plus baseline correlations between psychedelic history and panpsychist or anti-materialist views.\\\",\n        \\\"The truthmaking and alethic-fact grounding source asks whether truthmaking behaves like a strict ordering relation, arguing through reflexive, symmetric, and non-transitive cases that grounding-like relations need not be strict orders.\\\",\n        \\\"A synthesis-worthy page could examine how commitments to non-physicalist metaphysical views interact with truthmaking assumptions: not whether psychedelics establish any metaphysics, but how belief movement toward panpsychism or dualism might depend on implicit views about what makes propositions true and how truth facts are grounded. The evidence justifies a conceptual comparison, not a causal or doctrinal bridge between the sources.\\\"\n      ],\n      \\\"claim_ids\\\": [\n        \\\"claim-psychedelic-use-is-associated-with-significant-shifts-away-from-hard-physicalist--b7e61a4e9b3c\\\",\n        \\\"claim-greater-lifetime-psychedelic-use-correlates-with-stronger-baseline-panpsychist-b--a024d2968b54\\\",\n        \\\"claim-in-a-randomized-controlled-depression-trial-psilocybin-therapy-produced-shifts-a--7cfb0c0f75e7\\\",\n        \\\"claim-patients-who-clinically-responded-to-psilocybin-therapy-showed-greater-shifts-aw--b78b1f525f61\\\",\n        \\\"claim-truthmaking-is-a-species-of-grounding-because-the-relation-between-a-truthmaker--4d84e79d3baf\\\",\n        \\\"claim-alethic-fact-grounding-is-a-species-of-grounding-in-which-a-truthmaker-grounds-t--9c9dc5afedc6\\\",\n        \\\"claim-grounding-is-not-a-strict-order-because-it-is-neither-transitive-irreflexive-nor--0dc6a102d51b\\\",\n        \\\"claim-truthmaking-and-alethic-fact-grounding-are-non-asymmetric-because-distinct-propo--9d116dfbb4b5\\\"\n      ],\n      \\\"source_ids\\\": [\n        \\\"source-04-psychedelics-alter-metaphysical-beliefs--0d1ce18240f0\\\",\n        \\\"source-02-grounding-is-not-a-strict-order--7c76f525b4e3\\\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \\\"topic_id\\\": \\\"topic-experience-wellbeing-and-generalized-identity\\\",\n      \\\"title\\\": \\\"Experience, Well-Being, and Generalized Identity\\\",\n      \\\"structure_type\\\": \\\"wiki\\\",\n      \\\"sections\\\": [\n        \\\"The psychedelic-belief source links shifts away from hard materialism with psychological well-being, clinical response, emotional synchrony, and contextual moderators, while also noting sample-selection and contextual limitations.\\\",\n        \\\"The generalized-identity source analyzes essence and grounding through a non-factive no-difference operator, distinguishing essence from mere necessary equivalence and connecting grounding to identity-like structure.\\\",\n        \\\"This topic can synthesize two kinds of transformation: empirical change in metaphysical self-orientation and philosophical accounts of what it is for something to be what it is. The connection is conceptual rather than evidential: source 04 does not use generalized identity, but its findings concern changed commitments about mind, matter, and reality that source 03 helps frame in terms of essence, identity, and non-equivalent metaphysical structure.\\\"\n      ],\n      \\\"claim_ids\\\": [\n        \\\"claim-shifts-away-from-hard-materialism-are-positively-associated-with-increases-in-ps--4bb5f88069f2\\\",\n        \\\"claim-perceived-emotional-synchrony-during-the-psychedelic-ceremony-mediates-later-cha--adcb9ca374b4\\\",\n        \\\"claim-ceremonial-psychedelic-use-increased-fatalistic-determinism-at-four-weeks-in-the--f71a027b70cc\\\",\n        \\\"claim-the-combined-prospective-correlational-mechanistic-and-controlled-trial-evidence--bb114d52608c\\\",\n        \\\"claim-generalized-identity-is-a-non-factive-no-difference-operator-that-can-apply-to-f--7cb985988184\\\",\n        \\\"claim-grounding-and-essence-can-both-be-analyzed-in-terms-of-generalized-identity-yiel--e2abdab353f9\\\",\n        \\\"claim-necessary-entailment-or-equivalence-is-not-sufficient-for-essence-because-genera--162946956228\\\",\n        \\\"claim-full-generic-essence-is-captured-by-generalized-identity-being-f-is-what-it-is-t--96f5798ed301\\\"\n      ],\n      \\\"source_ids\\\": [\n        \\\"source-04-psychedelics-alter-metaphysical-beliefs--0d1ce18240f0\\\",\n        \\\"source-03-grounding-essence-and-identity--e857615fb05e\\\"\n      ]\n    }\n  ]\n}\nJSON\"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
