s that possible causal interpretation remains limited by sample selection and contextual confounds.\\\"\n        },\n        {\n          \\\"heading\\\": \\\"Generalized Identity Framework\\\",\n          \\\"body\\\": \\\"The generalized-identity source analyzes grounding and essence through a non-factive no-difference operator that can apply to factual and generic contents. On that account, full generic essence is captured by generalized identity, while necessary entailment or equivalence alone is not sufficient for essence because identity and grounding can distinguish essential structure from merely necessary coextension.\\\"\n        },\n        {\n          \\\"heading\\\": \\\"Synthesis Boundary\\\",\n          \\\"body\\\": \\\"This topic can synthesize empirical change in metaphysical self-orientation with a philosophical framework for essence, identity, and grounding. The connection is conceptual rather than evidential: the psychedelic source does not use generalized identity, but its findings concern changed commitments about mind, matter, and reality that can be framed against a theory separating essential structure from mere modal equivalence.\\\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \\\"source_ids\\\": [\n        \\\"source-04-psychedelics-alter-metaphysical-beliefs--0d1ce18240f0\\\",\n        \\\"source-03-grounding-essence-and-identity--e857615fb05e\\\"\n      ],\n      \\\"structure_type\\\": \\\"wiki\\\",\n      \\\"title\\\": \\\"Experience, Well-Being, and Generalized Identity\\\",\n      \\\"topic_id\\\": \\\"topic-experience-wellbeing-and-generalized-identity\\\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\nJSON\"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
